-- V47: Fix logical deletion unique index conflicts across all enterprise tables
-- Replaces static 'deleted' in unique indexes with conditional expression '(CASE WHEN deleted = 0 THEN 0 ELSE NULL END)'
-- This ensures active records remain strictly unique while allowing multiple logically deleted records without duplicate key violations.

